# The startup menu's glyph table is a binary dump of Unifont, not text.
#
# Git already guesses that from the NUL bytes, but the guess is a heuristic
# with a size limit, and this machine has `core.autocrlf = true`: if the guess
# ever went the other way, every LF byte in the table would be rewritten and
# the whole menu would come out as garbage. Say it explicitly.
crates/skyward-startup/src/font/glyphs.bin binary
